  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oil for Development Framework Agreement with UNEP</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Oil for Development (Ofd) Framework Agreement to strenghten the implementing capacity of the environmental component in Ofd. The background is limited capacity (time and manpower) in Norwegian implementing agencies vis a vis a growing demand for environmental competence transfer by Ofd partner countries.</narrative>
  </description>
